.TH DANBY-CLOCKPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-clockpendulum \- damped pendulum sustained by an escapement
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/clockpendulum
.SH MODEL
Damping removes energy throughout the swing. A signed escapement impulse acts
only inside a narrow interval around the center crossing, producing a stable
limit-cycle amplitude instead of unbounded periodic forcing.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/clockpendulum.b
